{"title":"2009 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f518ed174de13e6a2402ae626a72811ef176dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 9 - \\sqrt{36} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/798f1e8ae1f18c6cf2cb5d57f66368c3d73c6e66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c915675f4d73195f9956fa337b33789a75305c24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 9 - \\sqrt{36} + 1 = 2 \\times 9 - 6 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"256\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d69be163de7132a2a467dbb53566f62e25b0dc4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=18 - 6 + 1 = 12 + 1 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"265\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213910\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 913/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:33749:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017213910 and revision id 259888. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}